=== The Executive Notes === #^event:producer-monologue

-> "Choose the Continuity" #^transition:producer-to-console

= dialogue: Vice President of Destiny #^dialogue:producer-offer
    The Executive Producer: You can save every part of the world that tests well. I can even put your name above the title. #^beat:dialogue:producer-offer:1

? Answer the offer #^decision:answer-producer
* [Reject ownership of destiny] #^outcome:reject-producer
    ~ $"ambition"<variable:ambition> = false
* [Ask about the dental plan] #^outcome:consider-promotion
    ~ $"ambition"<variable:ambition> = true
